**Likely layers, in request order**

| Layer | Default | Where |
|---|---|---|
| Dev's client (axios/fetch) | varies | Dev's code |
| GCP LB backend service | 30s | Console |
| LB URL map route timeout | inherits backend | Console |
| Nginx on the VM | 60s (`proxy_read_timeout`) | VM |
| App server (gunicorn/uvicorn/php-fpm) | 30s (gunicorn) | VM |

